---
description: Specific coding standards and conventions for Laravel package development, covering naming conventions.
globs: "*/src/**/*.*"
---
- File names: Match a class, interface, trait, or enum file to its terminating name (e.g., MyClass.php)
- Class and Enum names: Use PascalCase (e.g., MyClass)
- Method names: Use camelCase (e.g., myMethod)
- Variable and property names: Use camelCase (e.g., $articlesWithAuthor)
- Database columns: Use snake_case (e.g., meta_title)
- Constants and Enum Cases names: Use SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE (e.g., MY_CONSTANT)